title: 'Snowbridge: Ethereum Glamsterdam Upgrade Support'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds Gloas (Glamsterdam) support to the Snowbridge Ethereum beacon light client.

    EIP-7688 turns `BeaconState` and `BeaconBlockBody` into progressive containers, so every
    generalized index moves.

    EIP-7732 removes `execution_payload` from `BeaconBlockBody`, leaving a builder's bid that
    commits to the *parent* execution block hash. A proof carries that block's canonical RLP
    header, authenticated by `keccak256(bytes) == committed hash`, and reads `receipts_root`
    out of it.

crates:
- name: snowbridge-beacon-primitives
  bump: major
- name: snowbridge-pallet-ethereum-client
  bump: major
- name: snowbridge-pallet-ethereum-client-fixtures
  bump: minor
- name: snowbridge-pallet-inbound-queue
  bump: none
- name: snowbridge-pallet-inbound-queue-v2
  bump: none
- name: bridge-hub-rococo-runtime
  bump: patch
- name: bridge-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
